WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.352
The 2000s.

00:00:01.352 --> 00:00:03.670
War, Scandal and Reckoning.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:08.886
Canada deploys to Afghanistan — 158 soldiers killed, over 2,000 wounded.

00:00:08.886 --> 00:00:11.909
The Sponsorship Scandal brings down the Liberal government.

00:00:11.909 --> 00:00:14.761
The Gomery Commission reveals systematic corruption.

00:00:14.761 --> 00:00:17.761
Stephen Harper wins on an accountability platform.
